    "id": "sd6-kode-prosedur-kebun",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "level": "SD6",
    "mechanic": "pilah",
    "competencyIds": [
      "KODE.SD6.SUBRUTIN.02"
    ],
    "instructionKey": "instruksi",
    "locale": {
      "id": {
        "judul": "Prosedur Robot Kebun",
        "instruksi": "Program robot kebun punya bagian yang berulang. Pilih prosedur yang paling tepat: tepat satu satuan yang berulang, atau prosedur berparameter bila hanya angkanya yang berbeda.",
        "pilihan": "pilihan",
        "c1": "satu_lubang(): gali, tanam, siram, maju 2",
        "c2": "gali, tanam",
        "c3": "siram, maju 2, gali",
        "q1": "Robot kebun: gali, tanam, siram, maju 2, gali, tanam, siram, maju 2, gali, tanam, siram, maju 2. Bagian mana yang paling cocok dijadikan prosedur?",
        "c4": "panen_dua(): petik, petik, taruh di keranjang",
        "c5": "pulang()",
        "c6": "taruh di keranjang, petik",
        "q2": "Robot panen: petik, petik, taruh di keranjang, petik, petik, taruh di keranjang, petik, petik, taruh di keranjang, pulang. Prosedur mana yang paling tepat?",
        "c7": "satu_pot(): maju 1, siram, siram",
        "c8": "siram()",
        "c9": "siram, maju 1",
        "q3": "Siram pot berbaris: maju 1, siram, siram, maju 1, siram, siram, maju 1, siram, siram, maju 1, siram, siram. Prosedur apa yang paling berguna?",
        "c10": "baris(n): maju n, tanam n biji",
        "c11": "baris2() dan baris5()",
        "c12": "tanam()",
        "q4": "Dua bagian ini sama kecuali angkanya: (maju 2, tanam 2 biji) dan (maju 5, tanam 5 biji). Prosedur yang paling berguna adalah…",
        "c13": "siram(tanaman, liter): ambil liter air, siram tanaman",
        "c14": "siram_mawar()",
        "c15": "ambil_air()",
        "q5": "Program: ambil 1 liter air, siram mawar; ambil 3 liter air, siram pisang; ambil 2 liter air, siram cabai. Prosedur yang paling baik adalah…",
        "c16": "kalau perlu diubah, cukup ubah di satu tempat",
        "c17": "supaya robot berjalan lebih cepat",
        "c18": "supaya tidak perlu menanam",
        "q6": "Prosedur tanam_bibit() dipakai di 5 petak kebun. Apa untungnya menulisnya sebagai prosedur?",
        "c19": "beri_makan_ayam()",
        "c20": "buka gerbang, kumpulkan telur",
        "c21": "sapu_kandang()",
        "q7": "Program pagi: buka gerbang, beri makan ayam, kumpulkan telur, beri makan ayam, sapu kandang, beri makan ayam. Bagian mana yang cocok jadi prosedur?",
        "c22": "ulangi 8 kali: cangkul()",
        "c23": "cangkul() saja",
        "c24": "ayun 8, tarik 8",
        "q8": "Prosedur cangkul() = ayun, tarik. Petak kebun butuh 8 kali cangkul. Program terpendek adalah…",
        "c25": "satu_bunga(): terbang 3, isap madu",
        "c26": "isap madu, terbang 3, isap madu",
        "c27": "kembali_ke_sarang()",
        "q9": "Robot lebah: terbang 3, isap madu, terbang 3, isap madu, terbang 3, isap madu, kembali ke sarang. Prosedur mana yang paling pas?",
        "c28": "pagar(panjang): ulangi 4: maju panjang, kanan",
        "c29": "pagar_kecil() dan pagar_besar()",
        "c30": "kanan()",
        "q10": "Pagar kebun kecil: ulangi 4: maju 3, kanan. Pagar kebun besar: ulangi 4: maju 6, kanan. Prosedur yang paling berguna adalah…",
        "c31": "buat prosedur saat_hujan()",
        "c32": "tulis ulang di setiap tempat",
        "c33": "hapus bagian itu",
        "q11": "Bagian 'kalau hujan: tutup atap rumah kaca, matikan pompa' ditulis di 3 tempat dalam program. Sebaiknya…",
        "c34": "sepasang(): tanam jagung, tanam kacang",
        "c35": "tanam jagung, tanam kacang, tanam jagung",
        "c36": "tanam_jagung()",
        "q12": "Pola tanam: jagung, kacang, jagung, kacang, jagung, kacang. Prosedur mana yang paling tepat?"
      },
      "en": {
        "judul": "Garden Robot Procedures",
        "instruksi": "The garden robot's program has parts that repeat. Choose the best procedure: exactly one repeating unit, or a procedure with a parameter when only the number changes.",
        "pilihan": "choices",
        "c1": "one_hole(): dig, plant, water, forward 2",
        "c2": "dig, plant",
        "c3": "water, forward 2, dig",
        "q1": "Garden robot: dig, plant, water, forward 2, dig, plant, water, forward 2, dig, plant, water, forward 2. Which part fits best as a procedure?",
        "c4": "pick_two(): pick, pick, put in basket",
        "c5": "go_home()",
        "c6": "put in basket, pick",
        "q2": "Harvest robot: pick, pick, put in basket, pick, pick, put in basket, pick, pick, put in basket, go home. Which procedure fits best?",
        "c7": "one_pot(): forward 1, water, water",
        "c8": "water()",
        "c9": "water, forward 1",
        "q3": "Watering a row of pots: forward 1, water, water, forward 1, water, water, forward 1, water, water, forward 1, water, water. Which procedure is most useful?",
        "c10": "row(n): forward n, plant n seeds",
        "c11": "row2() and row5()",
        "c12": "plant()",
        "q4": "These two parts are the same except for the number: (forward 2, plant 2 seeds) and (forward 5, plant 5 seeds). The most useful procedure is…",
        "c13": "water(plant, litres): fetch litres of water, water the plant",
        "c14": "water_rose()",
        "c15": "fetch_water()",
        "q5": "Program: fetch 1 litre of water, water the rose; fetch 3 litres, water the banana; fetch 2 litres, water the chilli. The best procedure is…",
        "c16": "if it needs changing, you change it in one place",
        "c17": "so the robot walks faster",
        "c18": "so nothing needs planting",
        "q6": "The procedure plant_seedling() is used in 5 garden plots. What is the benefit of writing it as a procedure?",
        "c19": "feed_hens()",
        "c20": "open the gate, collect eggs",
        "c21": "sweep_coop()",
        "q7": "Morning program: open the gate, feed the hens, collect eggs, feed the hens, sweep the coop, feed the hens. Which part fits as a procedure?",
        "c22": "repeat 8 times: hoe()",
        "c23": "just hoe()",
        "c24": "swing 8, pull 8",
        "q8": "The procedure hoe() = swing, pull. The plot needs 8 hoe strokes. The shortest program is…",
        "c25": "one_flower(): fly 3, sip nectar",
        "c26": "sip nectar, fly 3, sip nectar",
        "c27": "back_to_hive()",
        "q9": "Bee robot: fly 3, sip nectar, fly 3, sip nectar, fly 3, sip nectar, back to the hive. Which procedure fits best?",
        "c28": "fence(length): repeat 4: forward length, right",
        "c29": "small_fence() and big_fence()",
        "c30": "right()",
        "q10": "Small garden fence: repeat 4: forward 3, right. Big garden fence: repeat 4: forward 6, right. The most useful procedure is…",
        "c31": "make a procedure when_raining()",
        "c32": "rewrite it in every place",
        "c33": "delete that part",
        "q11": "The part 'if it rains: close the greenhouse roof, switch off the pump' is written in 3 places in the program. It is best to…",
        "c34": "a_pair(): plant corn, plant beans",
        "c35": "plant corn, plant beans, plant corn",
        "c36": "plant_corn()",
        "q12": "Planting pattern: corn, beans, corn, beans, corn, beans. Which procedure fits best?"
      }
    },
